{"about_the_game":"The time has come when people need your environmental orientation skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this casual game, you will be the guide of several travelers who got lost and need to reach their desired destination. Unfortunately, you will not set a good example for others, but instead, you will help someone cross the street safely without being put at risk of being hit by a car.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEveryone is counting on you, and take care that no one needs unpleasant news in the city. No car is coming? Let's run away!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- 15 levels<br />\r\n- Heavy traffic<br />\r\n- Several groups of tourists","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2159880?t=1765008687","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2159880?t=1765008687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765008687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765008687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>FIND HMUR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159880/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.poster.avif?t=1765008687\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159880/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.webm?t=1765008687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159880/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8